      "acceptedAnswers": [
        "第四象限"
      ],
      "explanationZhHans": "由 (1+i)z = 2 - i 得 z = (2 - i)/(1+i) = (2 - i)(1 - i)/((1+i)(1 - i)) = (2 - 2i - i + i^2)/(1 - i^2) = (2 - 3i - 1)/(1 + 1) = (1 - 3i)/2 = 1/2 - (3/2)i，实部正，虚部负，对应点 (1/2, -3/2) 在第四象限。",
